                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.60p2/33: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Latvia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Coleman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-04-20T13:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 20,
                                1928—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received April 20—9:45
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>36. Department’s 24, April 18, 3 p.m. United States-Latvian treaty of friendship,
                    commerce and consular rights signed at noon today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Coleman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
